      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Hello, doctor! I'm not sure I'm in the right place, because everyone says my blood pressure's great, but I feel light-headed, especially when I get up quickly, and I wondered if my pressure's too low.",
