      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's a very reasonable question. When does the light-headedness happen?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:23",
      "end_timestamp": "00:29",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "When I stand up from a chair, or the loo, or in the shower. Everything goes sort of fuzzy, and I have to hold on.",
